{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121882","id":4158764658,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc734bZy","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121882","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121882.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121882.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121882","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121882/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121882/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121882/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b0a5fb6759bc551ca8aa415611b5dd6ec58218d5","number":121882,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Generalize `AudioStream` editor preview support","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14356\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14348\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14296\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14661\r\n- Supersedes #116623\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR has been reworked as per the discussion [here](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/audio/thread/md48k5i8CSqns4xgX). Thanks to @smix8 & @KoBeWi for the architecture suggestions that led to the rework.\r\n\r\nThe outcome of the discussion was:\r\n- to split the shared `AudioStreamEditor` UI into a reusable base that contains the common controls (play/pause/stop, timeline, duration label, indicator, etc.), but doesn't know how a waveform is generated.\r\n- to keep the existing WAV editor as a core editor plugin inheriting from that shared UI, responsible for creating its own waveform preview.\r\n- to move MP3 & OGG Vorbis support into module-specific editor inspector/resource plugins that also inherit from the shared UI & handle their own preview generation.\r\n- if a stream-specific editor doesn't provide a waveform preview, the shared UI displays the \"Waveform preview not available\" placeholder while still providing playback controls.\r\n\r\nAnother PR will be created for the unification. For now, only audio streams has been reworked. MP3 & OGG Vorbis have their own editor for now. \r\n\r\nWhile this PR is a fresh implementation, it reuses several ideas from @seppoday's earlier work in #117394. Thanks for laying the groundwork :smile: \r\n\r\n### Showcase:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14fb9dfe-1882-450e-b284-3a36f3d7d2c0\r\n\r\n\r\n### MRP:\r\n[test-2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30497850/test-2.zip)\r\n\r\n### AI Disclosure:\r\nThis PR doesn't use AI, it's all human written code & same goes for the desc 🙃","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancem